sequenceDiagram
    participant HF as HuggingFace API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reg as Container Registries<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GH as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Ext as model-extractor<br/>(CI Build)
    participant Files as YAML Catalog Files<br/>(data/*.yaml)
    participant Konflux as Konflux Build<br/>(Container Image)
    participant Sidecar as model-metadata-collection<br/>Sidecar Container
    participant Dash as RHOAI Dashboard

    Note over Ext: Flow 1: Build-Time Catalog Generation

    Ext->>HF: GET /api/collections<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN (optional)
    HF-->>Ext: Model collections & metadata

    Ext->>Reg: GET manifests/layers<br/>Auth: Docker credentials
    Reg-->>Ext: OCI manifests & model cards

    Ext->>GH: GET /repos/.../contents<br/>Auth: Bearer GITHUB_TOKEN (optional)
    GH-->>Ext: Agent metadata & READMEs

    Note over Ext: Concurrent processing<br/>(max-concurrent: 5)

    Ext->>Files: Write YAML catalogs<br/>(models, validated, MCP, agents)

    Note over Konflux: Container Build

    Files->>Konflux: COPY data/ /app/data<br/>(Dockerfile.konflux)
    Konflux->>Sidecar: Push to quay.io/rhoai/<br/>odh-model-metadata-collection-rhel9

    Note over Sidecar: Flow 2: Runtime Data Serving

    Sidecar->>Sidecar: sleep infinity<br/>(no network, no ports)

    Dash->>Sidecar: Volume mount /app/data<br/>(Kubernetes RBAC)
    Sidecar-->>Dash: Read-only YAML catalogs<br/>(models, MCP servers, agents)
